  "program": {
    "module": {
      "summary": "Local Government Finance Act 1992 s.11 — council tax discounts on a\nchargeable dwelling for any day.\n\n  s.11(1)(a): exactly one non-disregarded resident              → 25% discount\n  s.11(1)(b): two or more residents, all but one disregarded    → 25% discount\n  s.11(2):    no non-disregarded residents and no override      → 50% discount\n  otherwise:  full charge\n\n\"Appropriate percentage\" is 25% unless the Secretary of State varies it by\norder (s.11(3)). Disregard determination (Schedule 1: full-time students,\nseverely mentally impaired, foreign diplomats, etc.) is pre-applied by the\ncaller via the per-person boolean `is_disregarded`. Empty-home override\n(ss.11A/11B/11C/12/12A/12B) is pre-applied via `empty_home_override_applies`."
    },
